{"SKILL.md": "---
name: demo-contract-balance
description: 仅用模拟金额核对未付款余额，供平台演示，不作责任或合规结论。
metadata:
  ontology-one.manifest: assets/ontology-one.json
---

# 【演示】合同付款余额核对

输入合同金额和累计付款金额，金额单位均为元。
未付款余额等于两者差额，最低为零；付款超过合同金额时另行提示。
结果只表示算术差额，不能据此认定违规、未履约或责任归属。
", "scripts/balance.py": "import json, sys
value = json.load(sys.stdin)
amount, paid = value['amount'], value['paid']
print(json.dumps({'unpaid': max(0, amount - paid), 'overpaid': paid > amount}))
", "assets/ontology-one.json": "{
  "applicability": "只用于模拟合同金额核对；金额单位须同为元。",
  "entrypoint": "scripts/balance.py",
  "inputs": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "amount": {
        "description": "合同约定的总金额，单位为元。",
        "minimum": 0,
        "title": "合同金额",
        "type": "number"
      },
      "paid": {
        "description": "截至观察时点已经支付的金额，单位为元。",
        "minimum": 0,
        "title": "累计付款金额",
        "type": "number"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "amount",
      "paid"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "outputs": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "overpaid": {
        "description": "只表示算术比较结果，不代表违规或责任认定。",
        "title": "是否超过合同金额",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "unpaid": {
        "description": "合同金额减累计付款金额，最低为零，单位为元。",
        "minimum": 0,
        "title": "未付款余额",
        "type": "number"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "unpaid",
      "overpaid"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "steps": [
    {
      "instruction": "按同一合同和相同单位比较合同金额与累计付款，计算非负余额并提示超付，不作责任判断。",
      "title": "核对模拟金额"
    }
  ],
  "test_cases": [
    {
      "expected_output": {
        "overpaid": false,
        "unpaid": 70
      },
      "input": {
        "amount": 100,
        "paid": 30
      },
      "name": "部分付款"
    },
    {
      "expected_output": {
        "overpaid": false,
        "unpaid": 0
      },
      "input": {
        "amount": 100,
        "paid": 100
      },
      "name": "刚好付清"
    },
    {
      "expected_output": {
        "overpaid": true,
        "unpaid": 0
      },
      "input": {
        "amount": 100,
        "paid": 120
      },
      "name": "超过合同金额"
    }
  ]
}
"}

